    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "What's the top idea?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Many scientists think stripes help keep biting flies away. The flies get confused by the stripes and don't land well.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🪰",
        "text": "Bye-bye, biting flies!",
        "cue": "flies",
        "sub": "Stripes confuse them",
        "sub_cue": "confused"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Ha! The flies get all mixed up?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Yes! When scientists put striped coats on horses, fewer flies landed on them.",
      "punch": "fewer",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🐴",
        "text": "Striped coats on horses",
        "cue": "horses",
        "sub": "Fewer flies landed!",
        "sub_cue": "fewer"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Are there other ideas?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Some think stripes might help zebras stay cool in the hot sun, or confuse a lion when the whole herd runs together.",
      "board": {
        "type": "gallery",
        "title": "Other ideas",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🌡️",
